000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RATLLD01.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE UNDERWRITING SYSTEMS.
000400*================================================================
000500* RATLLD01  LANDLORD RATING
000600* CALLED BY PRMCALC (BATCH) AND PRMCALC0 (CICS) AS 'RATLLD01'.
000700* SETS RATE-BASE-PREMIUM FROM THE SUM-INSURED BAND, THEN ADDS
000800* LINE LOADINGS AND DISCOUNTS FROM THE 60-BYTE RISK DETAIL.
000900* BANDS AND RATES ARE THE SAME AS dw.ref_rate_band IN claimsdb.
001000*================================================================
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001300     COPY RDLLD.
001400 01  WS-BAND                     PIC X(02).
001500 01  WS-PCT                      PIC 9V9999.
001600 LINKAGE SECTION.
001700     COPY POLREC.
001800     COPY RATEREC.
001900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD.
002000 0000-MAIN.
002100     MOVE POL-RISK-DETAIL TO WS-LLD-DETAIL
002200     PERFORM 1000-BASE-RATE
002300     PERFORM 2000-LOADINGS
002400     MOVE ZERO TO RATE-RETURN-CODE
002500     GOBACK.
002600 1000-BASE-RATE.
002700     EVALUATE TRUE
002800         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 200000
002900             MOVE 'B1' TO WS-BAND
003000             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003100                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00281
003200         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 500000
003300             MOVE 'B2' TO WS-BAND
003400             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003500                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00126
003600         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 1200000
003700             MOVE 'B3' TO WS-BAND
003800             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003900                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00117
004000         WHEN OTHER
004100*            ABOVE THE TOP BAND: RATE AT THE TOP BAND, REFER
004200             MOVE 'XX' TO WS-BAND
004300             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
004400                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00117
004500             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
004600     END-EVALUATE
004700     IF RATE-BASE-PREMIUM < 160.00
004800         MOVE 160.00 TO RATE-BASE-PREMIUM
004900     END-IF.
005000 2000-LOADINGS.
005100     IF WS-UNITS > 6
005200         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
005300             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
005400     END-IF
005500     EVALUATE WS-TENANT-TYPE
005600         WHEN 'P'
005700             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
005800                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
005900         WHEN 'S'
006000             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
006100                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.075
006200         WHEN 'B'
006300             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
006400                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.150
006500         WHEN OTHER
006600             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
006700     END-EVALUATE
006800     IF WS-RENT-GUARANTEE = 'Y'
006900         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007000             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.075
007100     END-IF
007200     IF WS-HMO = 'Y'
007300         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007400             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.125
007500     END-IF
007600     IF WS-VACANT-UNITS > 1
007700         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007800             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.025
007900     END-IF.
